one cam unwatched.\n\n## Method note (RTSP digest probe recipe)\nthingino/LIVE555: DESCRIBE needs Accept header absent, digest auth\nwith quoted params; SETUP per-track URI rtsp://IP/ch0/trackN with\nTransport interleaved=2N-2N+1; PLAY needs Session + Range. Audio-only\nSETUP on track2 works on all three probed cams (.103/.104/.201).\nFirst SETUP attempt on .104 timed out once, then 3/3 clean -- the\ncamera's control plane is slow under load, not dead.\nEOF\ngit add knowledge/aria/tri-cam-freeze-2026-09-19-c116.md && git commit -q -m \"c116 addendum2: .104 NOT power-dead -- serves RTSP+audio on fresh conns; census CAMS blind to .104 by config; ext4 recording dead since 14:09Z watchdog give-up\" && git push -q origin main 2>&1 | tail -1; echo pushed"}}}]},{"role":"tool","content":"[17:20:59] pushed\n\n[t+18:04/60:00 c93/300]"},{"role":"assistant","content":null,"tool_calls":[{"id":"call_derz3aar","function":{"index":0,"name":"execute_code_local","arguments":{"command":"ssh -o UserKnownHostsFile=/tmp/aria_known_hosts -o ConnectTimeout=5 root@10.66.0.5 '\necho \"=== ext4 NOW: does frigate have a consumer on it? (post-restart check) ===\"\nss -tn | grep \"192.168.2.104:554\"\necho\necho \"=== frigate ext4 ffmpeg process? ===\"\npodman exec frigate ps aux 2>/dev/null | grep -E \"exterior_4\" | head -3 || echo \"ps failed\"\necho\necho \"=== go2rtc ext4 producer id 425: still alive? ===\"\nnsenter -t $(pgrep -x go2rtc) -n curl -s -m 5 \"http://127.0.0.1:1984/api/streams?src=exterior_4\" 2>/dev/null | python3 -c \"\nimport json,sys\nd=json.load(sys.stdin)\nfor p in d.get(\\\"producers\\\",[]):\n    if isinstance(p,dict): print(\\\"producer id:\\\",p.get(\\\"id\\\"))\nprint(\\\"consumers:\\\", len(d.get(\\\"consumers\\\",[])))\n\"\n' 2>&1"}}}]},{"role":"tool","content":"[17:21:02] === ext4 NOW: does frigate have a consumer on it? (post-restart check) ===\nESTAB 0      0            192.168.2.69:41826      192.168.2.104:554  \n\n=== frigate ext4 ffmpeg process? ===\n\n=== go2